# OWNER_PASSWORD: initial owner password, at least 20 characters; generated by npm run setup
# SESSION_SECRET: random signing secret, at least 32 characters; generated by setup
# APP_ORIGIN: exact origin accepted for writes; local default http://127.0.0.1:3000
# COOKIE_SECURE: true for HTTPS deployment; false only for loopback HTTP
# DATABASE_PATH: optional SQLite path, defaults to data/site.sqlite
